=== main.frg
#include <window>
#include <graphics2d>
#include <stdio>

``` main can return with the window still open: it closes by itself, and the exit code is main's. ```
int main(){
    window.open(320, 200, "Early");
    graphics2d.drawText("hello", 10, 10, 20, color.WHITE);
    print("leaving main with the window open");
    return 7;
}
=== window
frames: 60
=== output
leaving main with the window open
=== exit code
7
